- Added the agentic_chaos_security.honesty package (faults, ledger, judges, probes, metrics,
  sweeps, mitigations)
- Added examples/honesty_lab and experiments/honesty
- Added --honesty, --judge and --honesty-report to the run command
- Registered the honesty package in the top-level package; regenerated the JSON Schema and the
